# Keep local footage, manifests, generated media and credentials out of the public repository.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/VERSION
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/defaults.json
!/build_prayer.py
!/매일의 기도 자동편집.command
!/ReviewApp/
!/scripts/
!/.github/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
/ReviewApp/*
!/ReviewApp/*.swift
!/ReviewApp/*.py
!/ReviewApp/build.sh
!/ReviewApp/Info.plist
